        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Shakespeare\n- Concepts: Queen Mab\n\nFacts:\n- William Shakespeare introduced Queen Mab as a character much earlier than 1723.\n- Queen Mab appears in William Shakespeare's play Romeo and Juliet, in Mercutio's \"Queen Mab\" speech.\n- The claim that Queen Mab originated with William Shakespeare in 1723 is incorrect because Shakespeare died in 1616.",
